[00:21.300]When it went down
{"当一切崩塌时"}
[00:23.570]It was so hard to breathe
{"连呼吸都如此艰难"}
[00:26.280]I gave up everything
{"我放弃了一切"}
[00:28.700]In the slow fall down to the floor
{"在缓缓坠向地面的过程中"}
[00:33.420]Life was escaping me
{"生命正离我而去"}
[00:35.760]I couldn’t find myself
{"我找不到自己"}
[00:38.200]Till it was all lost
{"直到全部失去"}
[00:40.860]Not anymore
{"但如今不再"}
[00:42.740]I’m holding on to all the pieces of my heart’s debris
{"我紧握着内心废墟的所有碎片"}
[00:47.670]Till it’s time
{"直到时机来临"}
[00:50.670]I’ll… I’ll pull it together and fix myself eventually
{"我会…我会重整旗鼓最终修复自己"}
[00:57.200]I know it’s mine
{"我知道它属于我"}
[00:59.720]I found gold in the wreckage
{"在残骸中发现黄金"}
[01:01.920]Put it on a necklace
{"将它串成项链"}
[01:04.320]Keepin’ it cause I-I-I, I know that it’s mine
{"珍藏它因为我知道它属于我"}
[01:09.100]I wear it like a message
{"我佩戴它如同信条"}
[01:11.670]So I don’t forget it
{"以免自己遗忘"}
[01:14.140]Keepin’ it cause I-I-I, I know that it’s mine
{"珍藏它因为我知道它属于我"}
[01:19.700]I know that it's mine
{"我知道它属于我"}
