{"我知道它属于我"}
[01:56.160]I know that it's mine
{"我知道它属于我"}
[02:02.970]Facing the change
{"直面改变"}
[02:05.320]But it’s still tough to see
{"却仍难看清方向"}
[02:07.900]At first I fought it all
{"最初我抗拒一切"}
[02:10.900]I was so mean
{"如此刻薄倔强"}
[02:12.900]I’m still unsure
{"依旧不确定"}
[02:15.100]How it’s supposed to be
{"未来该是什么模样"}
[02:17.470]But digging everyday now by the skin of my teeth
{"但如今每天都在用尽全力挣扎向上"}
[02:22.070]Until I learn
{"直到我学会"}
[02:24.620]I’m holding on to all the pieces of my heart’s debris
{"紧握着这颗心破碎后的每片残章"}
[02:29.330]Till it’s time
{"待时机来临"}
[02:32.480]I’ll… I’ll pull it together and fix myself eventually
{"我会…我会重整自我终将修复创伤"}
[02:39.010]I know it’s mine
{"我深知它属于我"}
